    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐυπό-ληπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to take up,
			light</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.Astr.
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in 
				Comp.
			, <i>more easily enclosed</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				438a15
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Sens.</u>
				26.20
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				36.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>enjoying a good reputation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cod.Just.
				1.4.26
			</span></i>
			<u>Intr.</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				128.18
			</span></i>.</div>
